      "actualRootReason": "Explaining natural active-ingredient separation is a genuine portion of the define-active-ingredient/isolation clause in mandatory LK4.3. Supplied example, unchanged molecules, extract/enriched fraction; no performed extraction or proven clinical activity. Only partial source contribution.",
