      "actualRootReason": "Actual Leistungsfach3.4.8(4) uses one further selected substance family and historical/current/future application-oriented R&D. Existing dye goal is a faithful selected carrier, not an official universal dye-only duty. Retain partial source binding, no silent choice-state claim.",
